OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1788193203
OL,3,CLionel Messi retires from
OL,4,Cinternational football
OL,6,FLionel Messi has announced his
OL,7,Fretirement from international football
OL,8,Fwith immediate effect, saying it was a
OL,9,Fdecision that "hurt".
OL,11,FThe 39-year-old captained Argentina to
OL,12,Fthe final of last month's World Cup,
OL,13,Fbut he was unable to prevent his
OL,14,Fnation from losing 1-0 to Spain, which
OL,15,Fproved to be the final match of his
OL,16,Finternational career.
OL,26,@qD@OOUqD@TO]
