OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1788193203
OL,3,CLionel Messi retires from
OL,4,Cinternational football
OL,6,FHanded his senior Argentina debut at
OL,7,Fthe age of 18, Messi went on to play
OL,8,F207 times for his country and scored
OL,9,F125 goals, with his crowning moment
OL,10,Farriving in 2022 when he led his team
OL,11,Fto a third World Cup triumph.
OL,13,F"After the time that has passed since
OL,14,Fthe final, and after giving it a lot
OL,15,Fof thought, I want to let everyone
OL,16,Fknow that I am retiring from the
OL,17,Fnational team," Messi said on
OL,18,FInstagram on Monday.
OL,26,@uD@AOUyD@OO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,303,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1788193203
OL,3,CLionel Messi retires from
OL,4,Cinternational football
OL,6,F"It is a decision that hurts and still
OL,7,Fhurts deep down but I understand that
OL,8,Fthe time has come. I swear to you that
OL,9,FI always gave it my all ` not just in
OL,10,Fthese last few years when we won
OL,11,Feverything, but before that too.
OL,13,F"I always fought and left everything
OL,14,Fon the field for this jersey, to bring
OL,15,Fyou joy and make you feel proud to be
OL,16,FArgentinian through football.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/5
