OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1788193203
OL,3,CLionel Messi retires from
OL,4,Cinternational football
OL,6,F"Time is running short, chapters come
OL,7,Fto a close and this is one that hurts
OL,8,Fme deeply. I love, have loved, and
OL,9,Fwill always love being part of the
OL,10,Fnational team.
OL,12,F"I've given everything I had, I have
OL,13,Fnothing left to give and besides,
OL,14,Fthere are some great young players
OL,15,Fcoming up who deserve to be here."
